      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This needs to be reverted. I literally cannot speak to anyone anymore because I'm disabled and have to laydown. I either have to blindly type and accept whatever gibberish comes out of my text box, or force to be stood up so I can communicate with a friend.\n\nYou can't even search settings because VRChat still hasn't figured out that the keyboard needs to always be on top... INCLUDING THE KEYS. If the system hud is behind the keyboard (which it needs to be to search settings), then half the keyboard doesn't work because the contact points are BEHIND the system hud.\n\nThis is the worst UI change ever.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
