      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "> type on keyboard that doesnt resemble a keyboard in terms of key pattern and has way too much space inbetween keys\n\n> turn 90 degrees to the right, respawn chatbox/keyboard\n\n> Keyboard suddenly in my right cheek, bring down infront of me\n\n> turn another 90 degrees to the right, keyboard suddenly 10 feet away infront of me\n\n> turn another 90 degrees, keyboard suddenly right infront of me, chatbox nowhere to be seen(behind the keyboard)\n\nWhat the fuck who coded this? The whole UI overhaul thats been going on has been nothing but a travesty",
